<title>UK: Dec Brent cargo trades Jan paper +30 cts, up 20 ct.</title>
<headline>Dec Brent cargo trades Jan paper +30 cts, up 20 ct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude oil loading December 11-13 traded 20 cents firmer from Tuesday at January paper +30 cents, trade sources said.</p>
<p>The trade took place between two major refiners.</p>
</text>
